model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-08
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 §4 item 77 (#201), plan §14, from the planner i77b: a covered day before the cut, so whether the plan is modelled past or booked depends on the day (c1, c3, 0.00 today; c5 as known inside the window)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date

move pay: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03-01..2026-03-07
  known 2026-03-08
  covers konto

ask c1: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask c2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) windows each
ask c3: flows(pay, 2026-03)
ask c4: flows(pay, 2026-03) windows each
ask c5: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-03-07
ask c6: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-03-07 windows each
